# Project TITAN — Smart Access Architecture

> **Primary:** `.cursor/rules/project-titan-official-architecture.mdc` · `docs/TITAN_OFFICIAL_ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Hybrid System

Paper · QR · Mobile · NFC(Future) — **동시 지원 · 상호 대체 ❌**

## Core Philosophy

```text
One Time Input → One Scan → One Workflow
```

- 데이터 1회 입력 · Master/Session 재사용
- QR/NFC 1회 → 업무 화면 직행 (메뉴 탐색 ❌)
- Paper/Smart/NFC 모두 **동일 Workflow 상태머신** (`titanWorkflowStatus.js`)

## Access Modes

| Mode | Status | Rule |
|------|--------|------|
| **Paper** | active | HTL · OUT · INV · DPR 출력 **삭제 금지** |
| **Smart (QR)** | active (설비) / planned (기타) | Smart Access ID → 기존 화면 deep link |
| **Future (NFC)** | planned | **QR와 동일 Smart Access ID** — Handler 공유 |

## Smart Access SSoT

- **Official Architecture:** `src/config/titanOfficialArchitecture.js`
  - `SMART_ACCESS_ID_REGISTRY` — canonical `NDK://` + legacy alias
  - `parseSmartAccessId()` · `buildCanonicalSmartAccessId()`
- **Route Registry:** `src/config/smartAccessArchitecture.js`
  - `SMART_ACCESS_TARGETS` — targetId · pathTemplate · registryId
  - `buildSmartAccessPath()` · `resolveSmartAccessPathFromId()`
  - `QR_PRINT_CENTER` — 향후 QR 관리 메뉴 설계
- **Workflow:** `src/config/titanV11Workflow.js`
- **Active impl:** `equipmentQr.js` — `NDK://EQ/{code}` + `NDK|EQ|{code}`

## Smart Access ID Registry

| Canonical | Legacy | targetId | Status |
|-----------|--------|----------|--------|
| `NDK://INCOMING` | `NDK\|IN\|REG` | `inboundRegister` | planned |
| `NDK://EQ/{code}` | `NDK\|EQ\|{code}` | `equipment` | **active** |
| `NDK://INSPECTION` | `NDK\|QC\|ROOM\|{code}` | `inspectionRegister` | planned |
| `NDK://CERTIFICATE` | `NDK\|QC\|CERT\|{code}` | `certificate` | planned |
| `NDK://OUTGOING` | `NDK\|OUT\|DOCK\|{code}` | `outboundRegister` | planned |
| `NDK://EQ/{code}` | `NDK\|EQ\|INFO\|{code}` | `equipmentMaster` | planned |

## Equipment QR Rules

- ONE QR per equipment (ION-01 · ION-02 · GAS-01 · SOFT-01)
- NOT per product · NOT per LOT · multi-copy OK

## Implementation Rules (Mandatory)

1. **New Smart target** — register in `SMART_ACCESS_ID_REGISTRY` + `SMART_ACCESS_TARGETS` first
2. **URL/ID parsing** — `parseSmartAccessId()` → `getSmartAccessTargetId()` → `buildSmartAccessPath()`
3. **NFC** — same Smart Access ID · 별도 NFC Handler ❌
4. **UI** — 승인된 화면 유지 · Smart = query/deep link + 기존 Modal/Panel만
5. **Workflow** — 상태 변경은 `titanWorkflowStatus.js`만

## QR Print Center (Future)

- Menu: 환경설정 → QR 관리 (`QR_PRINT_CENTER.plannedMenuPath`)
- PDF · 재출력 · 미리보기 · 인쇄

## Do Not

- Remove Paper print flows
- Create per-feature URL schemes outside official config
- Build separate mobile app shell before PM approval
- Change approved list layouts for Smart Access

